# Pruebas del Backend Cook It

## 1. Probar endpoint principal
GET http://localhost:3000

## 2. Probar health check  
GET http://localhost:3000/health

## 3. Registrar usuario
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Test123456",
  "confirmPassword": "Test123456"
}

## 4. Login con el usuario creado
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com", 
  "password": "Test123456"
}

## 5. Obtener información del usuario (requiere token del login)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer JWT_TOKEN_HERE

## 6. Verificar token (requiere token del login)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/verify-token
Authorization: Bearer JWT_TOKEN_HERE